      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Adjusting your playspace goes outside the bounds of VRChat itself as you're offsetting your actual VR setup, which I think the VRChat team would like to avoid. Space grab for avatars could definitely be a useful feature, but the only way I could see something like this being implemented is if it was bound by world permissions.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
