  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-02-26T23:00:36.920Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think it would be nice if playspace mover aka \"airgrab\" was implemented into the game for all platforms. There could be options in your settings to change your key binds to use it or to disable it. It's a simple feature that most pc players use, and would make it easier for players to access it without needing to install another application.",
